# Dayflow — Human Resource Management System

> _Every workday, perfectly aligned._

Dayflow is a role-based **Human Resource Management System (HRMS)** that digitizes core HR
operations: employee onboarding & profiles, attendance tracking, leave / time-off management
with approval workflows, and payroll visibility. It serves two user classes — **Employees**
(self-service) and **Admin / HR Officers** (management & approvals).

This repository is architected as a **full-stack Next.js** application backed by **MySQL** via
**Prisma**, with authentication and role-based access control handled by **Auth.js (NextAuth v5)**.

