## 1. Project Overview

### Scope (MVP)

| Module | Employee | Admin / HR |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Auth & RBAC** | Sign up, sign in, session | Sign up, sign in, elevated role |
| **Dashboard** | Quick-access cards (profile, attendance, leave) | Employee list, attendance records, leave approvals |
| **Profile** | View all fields; edit limited (address, phone, picture) | View & edit **all** employee details |
| **Attendance** | Self check-in / check-out; view **own** daily/weekly | View **all** employees' attendance |
| **Leave** | Apply (type, date range, remarks); track status | View all requests; approve / reject with comments |
| **Payroll** | **Read-only** salary structure | View all; update salary structure |

### Explicitly deferred (see [Roadmap](#12-roadmap--future-enhancements))

These are listed as _Future Enhancements_ in the spec and are **out of scope for the 8-hour MVP**:

- Email verification on sign-up
- Email & notification alerts
- Analytics & reports dashboard (salary slips, attendance reports)
- Document upload/storage

### User Classes

- **Admin / HR Officer** — manages employees, approves leave & attendance, views/edits payroll.
- **Employee** — views personal profile, attendance & salary (read-only), applies for leave.

